&lt;div class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-0&quot;&gt;● Ability to meaningfully review architectural proposals and guide technical trade-offs in a complex product space.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-2&quot; class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-1&quot;&gt;● Experience working with AI coding agents to produce performant and maintainable results.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;page-2&quot; class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-1&quot;&gt;● Experience collaborating with distributed teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-1&quot;&gt;● Working knowledge of statistical methods, such as sampling strategies, bayesian optimization, sensor fusion etc (nice to have).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS _0KLXrut28M _2XsHFMIZbP _0adFHsIZbP&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
