&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are Ocado Group,&lt;/strong&gt; and we&#39;re bringing world-class automation to online grocery. Our Ocado Smart Platform (OSP) combines cutting-edge robotics, AI, and IoT within our advanced CFCs (Customer Fulfilment Centres). We&#39;ve mastered the single pick, transforming online delivery for our global partners. Join us and be part of a team pushing the boundaries of retail technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oracle EPM is the backbone of Ocado Group’s finance department. You&#39;ll lead the team who maintain, develop and control our Oracle EPM Cloud platform. You will own the EPM platforms and their roadmap, run a clear and well-governed change process and keep the controls environment audit-ready. This is a hands-on leadership role in a fast-paced organisation. As our use of data, automation and AI tooling evolves, you will help shape how EPM fits into that picture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Service ownership and platform health&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end EPM service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure availability, performance and data integrity, including environment management (Development, UAT, Production) and management and testing of Oracle’s cloud updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain tested disaster recovery and business continuity plans for critical Finance activities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roadmap, demand and change&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the EPM change process and backlog, from request intake and business prioritisation through technical triage, design, build, testing, approval, release and sign-off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure the EPM estate is ready for budget cycles, chart of accounts changes and period-end deadlines, with clear plans and ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide solution design and architecture for EPM changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track the Oracle EPM product roadmap and recommend when and how to adopt new capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Controls, governance and risk&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the accountable owner for EPM IT general controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the EPM entries in the Finance Risk and Control Matrix (RACM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience owning or managing Oracle EPM Cloud&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading a technical or application team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with optimised calculation scripts and demonstrable knowledge of Essbase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of finance processes (budgeting, forecasting, consolidation, close) and of chart of accounts and hierarchy design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running change, release and incident processes in a controlled environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of IT general controls, access management and audit evidence requirements, ideally in a regulated or listed company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing suppliers and technology partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to explain technical topics clearly to Finance and non-technical audiences, and Finance topics clearly to technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong planning and prioritisation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in supporting our people with meaningful, flexible benefits that prioritise well-being and work-life balance. Here’s a snapshot of what you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time to recharge&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br&gt;25 days annual leave (rising to 27 after 5 years), plus the option to buy more – and 30 days a year to work from anywhere in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br&gt;Private Medical Insurance from your first month, wellbeing support through specialist apps and EAP, plus Income Protection and Life Assurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family-first policies&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br&gt;22 weeks paid maternity/primary carer leave and 6 weeks paid paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial support&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br&gt;Pension with employer matching up to 7%, share schemes (Sharesave &amp;amp; BAYE), and interest-free loans for train tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commuter perks&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br&gt;Cycle to Work Scheme and free shuttle buses to/from Hatfield and Welwyn Garden City stations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exclusive discounts&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br&gt;15% off at Ocado.com with free delivery (starting in your first month).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
