&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;ll bring fresh ideas and provide valuable input to enhance our talent pipeline processes and improve overall recruitment outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For example, every year at Picnic we organize a Business Course event for potential Analyst candidates (see video &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyQh6HZ_Pgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;). In 2026, it could be YOU the one recruiting for it, together with the support of our Analytics Recruitment team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
