&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What’s it like to manage the commercial engine of Europe’s fastest-growing online supermarket? At Picnic, we don&#39;t just buy products - we redefine how food reaches millions of homes by building smarter assortments, negotiating hard with global brands, and launching our own Private Label lines. 🥑🥐🍎&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our &lt;strong&gt;Category Management - Future Leaders Graduate Program&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll take full end-to-end commercial ownership from day one. You’ll sit at the intersection of quantitative analysis, supplier negotiations, and product strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will actually do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a rotation program or an advisory role. You won&#39;t just recommend what to sell - you will own the P&amp;amp;L of your category and execute every step yourself:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Category Strategy &amp;amp; Improvement Plans: &lt;/strong&gt;Build and execute clear commercial roadmaps for your category - analyzing performance gaps, setting growth targets, and continually balancing customer experience, gross margin, and long-term category health.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier Negotiation:&lt;/strong&gt; Prepare and lead negotiations that secure the best terms. From initial outreach to signed contracts, you&#39;ll own the process end-to-end&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Assortment Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Dive deep into customer purchase data, elasticity models, and unit economics to prune underperforming SKUs and introduce winning products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private Label Development&lt;/strong&gt;:Collaborate on the creation of Picnic’s own products - from sustainable packaging and pricing to quality checks and market positioning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Margin &amp;amp; Price Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously monitor cost changes, inflation impacts, and competitor pricing to protect margins while keeping Picnic unbeatable on price.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with supply chain, design, and analytics teams to align commercial goals with operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We set a high bar. We look for top-tier candidates who combine sharp quantitative thinking with a natural commercial drive and zero hesitation to pick up the phone and negotiate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finishing (or recently finished) an&lt;strong&gt; Msc &lt;/strong&gt;in Business, Economics, Finance, Econometrics, Supply Chain, Food Retail, or a related field (0–1 year of full-time work experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience gained via internships, student organizations, or extracurricular activities is mandatory - in &lt;strong&gt;fast-moving, high-intensity environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with &lt;strong&gt;complex data&lt;/strong&gt; to drive tangible business outcomes, whether that’s uncovering growth levers or building a winning negotiation strategy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy &lt;strong&gt;negotiating&lt;/strong&gt;. You hold your ground with experienced suppliers, build long-term value, and back up your positions with hard data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don&#39;t hand off contract administration, cost recalculations, or SKU setups to someone else - you &lt;strong&gt;execute every detail of your strategy yourself&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You &lt;strong&gt;constantly ask&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;&quot;Why does this product cost X to produce?&quot;&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;&quot;Why are we not carrying category Y?&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English (Dutch or German is a strong advantage for local supplier negotiations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Not sure which track fits you best?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Choose Category Management&lt;/strong&gt; if you are driven by &lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;60&quot;&gt;products, supplier negotiations, unit economics, and food trends.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Choose Strategy &lt;/strong&gt;if you are driven by &lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;43&quot;&gt;app user behavior, digital storefront optimization, and campaign execution.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Choose Analytics &lt;/strong&gt;if you are driven by &lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;44&quot;&gt;solving complex business problems, data modeling, and technical implementation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏼‍♂️Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼 Learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get ample opportunity to work on yourself at Picnic. We offer personal development through Lepaya courses, Academy trainings, and more. Interested in improving your mental wellbeing? Through OpenUp you get free access to trained psychologists and many courses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All the rest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real ownership. Real impact. Build from day one.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you an ambitious graduate ready to tackle complex&lt;strong&gt;,&lt;/strong&gt; real-world challenges at the intersection of data, strategy and tech?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The&lt;strong&gt; Analytics - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Future Leaders Graduate Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;at Picnic is a two-year launchpad for exceptional talents. From day one, you join a business team, own a business topic, and become an expert in your field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic, we’re building the future of grocery. Using cutting-edge technology and data-driven innovation, we challenge the status quo and build the world’s smartest, most customer-focused supermarket. &lt;br&gt;We move fast, think big, and turn bold ideas into tangible impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with ambition&lt;/strong&gt;: Bring your relentless determination, creativity, and grit. Take the driver’s seat and redefine the grocery shopping experience for millions. You will be expected to think independently, move fast, and deliver results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Steep learning curve&lt;/strong&gt;: Your growth comes from owning real problems, testing your ideas, learning from your mistakes and starting again. You&#39;ll blend hands-on training with immediate execution, you’ll move at a pace that accelerates your growth like nowhere else.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve real-life puzzles&lt;/strong&gt;: Spot opportunities, use tools at the forefront of technology, and own the outcome end to end. Not just making slides, but building the solution yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate across borders&lt;/strong&gt;: You’ll collaborate with teams across the Netherlands, Germany, and France, tackling challenges that redefine how Picnic operates at a European scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-performance environment&lt;/strong&gt;: You’ll work alongside some of the best teams in analytics and tech, people who set a high bar and expect you to do the same.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;From learning to leading&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Throughout the two-year program, you’ll own business-critical projects from start to finish, supported by mentorship, learning sessions, and regular feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll strengthen your leadership skills in project management, storytelling, stakeholder communication, and giving and receiving feedback, while sharpening your technical skills in Python, SQL, Excel, and PowerPoint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As your scope grows, so does your responsibility. You might scale your initial project or take on new challenges within the same domain. Either way, the pace is yours to set, and there’s always a new challenge to lead and an opportunity to make an impact. That’s why every journey is unique: there’s no standardized path through the program, just continuous opportunities to learn, and lead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you’ll make an impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From day one, you’ll be embedded in a business team, taking ownership in one of the following domains:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consumer&lt;/strong&gt; - Drive growth through pricing, supplier strategy, and our market strategy. Think: Shaping our successful market entry into new cities. Your decisions shape how millions of customers experience Picnic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech&lt;/strong&gt; -&amp;nbsp;Work at the intersection of product and infrastructure, building scalable systems that power our operations. Think: building software and algorithms our FCAs run on or launch new features in our app used by millions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics &lt;/strong&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Build the backbone of Picnic: robotic fulfilment, demand forecasting, route optimization across Europe and much more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t wait for permission. You see a problem, build the solution, and bring people with you, before anyone asks. You&#39;ve probably already started something: a project, a product, a business, an initiative that didn&#39;t exist until you made it happen.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;More specifically, you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are about to graduate (or recently graduated) a Masters in a &lt;strong&gt;quantitative field&lt;/strong&gt;: e.g., mathematics, econometrics, engineering, or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in &lt;strong&gt;high-performance environments:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;consulting, fast-growth startups, or competitive internships and know what it means to raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Show an &lt;strong&gt;entrepreneurial mindset&lt;/strong&gt;: you build, improve, and take ownership without being asked&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think like a builder&lt;/strong&gt;: hands-on, curious, and driven to challenge the status quo with practical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have already gained basic knowledge in &lt;strong&gt;PowerPoint, Python, SQL, Excel&lt;/strong&gt; or alternative coding languages&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Many strong candidates (particularly women) talk themselves out of applying because they don&#39;t tick every box. If this excites you and you believe you have what it takes, apply. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;We only hire when we find the right match. That’s why our selection process is intentionally highly selective.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Picnic?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow as we grow&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re scaling quickly across countries and millions of customers and this is just the start. Grow your impact as we grow; we invest in your path but the driver&#39;s seat is always yours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with other innovators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Work with a driven, energetic team that builds, wins, and celebrates together (think of legendary Friday drinks, our Ski trip and our parties)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kickstart your career.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Earn a competitive salary and step into a program designed to launch your long-term future at Picnic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;When are you joining?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fall Edition 2026&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Start dates: September, October&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;*earlier or later dates can be arranged, please indicate your preference in the application question&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spring Edition 2027&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Start dates: February, March&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;*earlier or later dates can be arranged, please indicate your preference in the application question&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍 Location: Full-time in Amsterdam, with periodic trips to DE or FR&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;There is no &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;deadline&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Our aim is to find the most ambitious people out there. We onboard talents on a monthly basis, so whether you join in April or August, you’ll always have a group of people sharing the ride.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🥗&lt;strong&gt;Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚲&lt;strong&gt;Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🗺️&lt;strong&gt;Relocation&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;If you’re moving from another country to join Picnic we make it as smooth as possible for you. We’ll cover your flight costs for you and your partner and kids, your first month&#39;s rent and moving costs (up to €2000), and help you with the 30% tax ruling setup and application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍎&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; development &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll get ample opportunity to work on yourself at Picnic. We offer personal development through Lepaya courses, Academy trainings, and more. Interested in improving your mental wellbeing? Through OpenUp you get free access to trained psychologists and many courses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⛳&lt;strong&gt;All the rest &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FAQ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do I need a quantitative background? &lt;/strong&gt;It&#39;s a strong advantage, but not a hard requirement. If your internships and projects demonstrate real hands-on ownership and data-driven thinking, we&#39;ll consider your application. You do need a Master&#39;s degree, basic knowledge of Python or SQL, and relevant work experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Does the program include rotations?&lt;/strong&gt; No, intentionally. We believe depth creates ownership, and ownership creates impact. Rather than rotating across teams, you’ll go deep in one area, build real expertise, and gradually expand your scope as your impact grows. If you have topic preferences, tell us during the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In what language should I apply?&lt;/strong&gt; English. Please include your CV and Master&#39;s degree transcript or any other relevant test scores (e.g., GMAT)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are the long-term opportunities after the program? &lt;/strong&gt;This program is a fast track into a high-impact career at Picnic, it’s an entry point for a long-term future, not a two-year stopover.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Career paths here are as varied as the people on them. Some grow vertically, building deep expertise and a team around them as their project expands. Others move laterally - from Commercial to Fulfilment, Distribution to Customer, or wherever their strengths and ambitions take them. What they share is real ownership, real impact, and a career they shaped themselves.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/yEQXLpeYN84?si=It-z9-XNLVMDeHEy&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;315&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3720 -&amp;nbsp;Director, Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fantastic opportunity to join WPP Media as a Strategy Director, shaping ambitious, insight-led media strategies that unlock growth for our clients. You will be a senior strategic partner, challenging the status quo, defining the role of communications and media in solving business problems, and turning complex opportunities into clear, compelling direction. Working across WPP Media, Production, Creative and Enterprise, you will lead annual planning and major brief responses, inspire award-winning thinking, and ensure strategies translate into distinctive, effective activation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the ultimate storyteller, you will author influential narratives, bring a clear point of view to clients and teams, and build trusted relationships across partner agencies. You will also champion data, technology, analytics, digital, performance and commerce, while creating a culture of learning, experimentation and high standards. Alongside client impact, you will contribute to agency growth through new business, incremental revenue opportunities and the development of future-facing strategic talent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media strategy and planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Define the business challenge and the role communications and media can play in solving it. Lead annual planning and major brief responses, pushing the work to be distinctive, creative and award-worthy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insight and discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify actionable audience, market and cultural insights that guide strategy, implementation, creativity and activation. Find the tension, jeopardy or opportunity in every brief and define clear sources of growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implementation, creativity and activation:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate strategy into an integrated media approach covering channels, audiences, phasing, messaging and budgets. Advance earned, shared, owned and paid thinking, introducing new partners and approaches where they add value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and measurement:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a culture of continuous learning and experimentation. Oversee client measurement frameworks and establish clear planning and buying principles for the client or category.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data, technology and analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure clients have a clear strategy for applying data, technology and analytics. Champion WPP Open and AI tools, and oversee the client’s Data Growth Plan and maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital, performance and commerce:&lt;/strong&gt; Advance high-performing digital strategies that help clients grow, while increasing maturity across digital, performance and commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication and presentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape compelling narratives for key presentations and special projects. Maintain the highest standards of strategic output and actively contribute points of view and provocations internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commerciality and new business:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify incremental revenue and profitability opportunities, take relevant products and propositions to clients, and play a leading role in new business pitches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People and culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Challenge and inspire client leadership and planning teams. Coach and nurture junior and high-potential planners, strengthening strategic and planning craft across the agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client and agency relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Become a trusted partner to senior clients and build strong, integrated relationships with creative, social, measurement and other specialist agency partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role, it will be critical to embrace WPP and WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by leading collectively to inspire transformational creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by balancing people and client experiences and cultivating trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by championing growth and development to mobilise the enterprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience developing integrated media and communications strategies within an agency, consultancy or client environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of marketing, advertising and the wider media ecosystem, including commercial, creative, audience, budget and measurement considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of converting insight into clear strategic direction and effective activation across paid, owned, earned and shared channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with data, analytics, technology and AI-enabled planning tools to improve decisions and client outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of digital, performance and commerce, with the ability to connect these disciplines to broader brand and growth objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written, verbal and presentation skills, with the ability to simplify complexity and influence senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial acumen and experience identifying growth opportunities, developing proposals and contributing to or leading pitches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leadership, coaching and collaboration skills, with a commitment to developing diverse, high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent judgement, attention to detail and the ability to prioritise and remain calm across multiple high-profile projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Honesty, integrity, curiosity and a constructive desire to find a better way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measures of Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive client feedback on strategy, planning, insight, measurement, experimentation and customer understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic work recognised through relevant UK media, effectiveness and channel awards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular adoption of WPP Open and appropriate AI tools, alongside measurable progress in clients’ data maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth in digital scope and profitability, supported by strong client satisfaction scores.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least two proactive commercial proposals and meaningful contribution to at least one new business pitch annually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong feedback from clients, colleagues and partners, together with positive team engagement and year-end development outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and championing growth and development for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media and WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Create an Open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through employee resource groups and frequent in-office events that showcase team wins, share thought leadership and celebrate holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we’re together, fostering creativity, collaboration and connection in an open and supportive environment. That’s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice for more information on how we process the information you provide. While we appreciate all applications received, only candidates selected for interview will be contacted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
