&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and maintaining production Ruby on Rails applications, including background jobs, APIs and data models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working across the stack in a mature codebase. Familiarity with Python backends and/or Vue frontends is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skill in designing or extending REST and/or GraphQL APIs with attention to scalability, maintainability and backward compatibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real enthusiasm for AI and hands-on experience using AI tools in your daily work. Experience designing and shipping AI-powered backend features or integrations is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven SQL and experience with relational databases such as PostgreSQL, including writing efficient queries and data modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience finding and fixing performance bottlenecks in applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and verbal communication, including technical proposals and documentation, in a remote, async, cross-functional team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Openness to learning and to applying skills from related technologies or fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
